        "content": "## REVIEW ACTIONS (human only)\nAPPROVE → APPROVED · REJECT → REJECTED · REQUEST_REVISION → REVISION_REQUESTED (+ ChatGPT revision brief).\nNever regenerates. A new version still needs `generation_authorized: true` in the pipeline.",
